ermined grisha inherit his ability in  order to fulfill the elderly  restorationist's goal kruger revealed  the name of the titan he would become  and explain the history of the founding  titan and king fritz's vow with the  founding titan renouncing all war as he  prepared to inject grisha with a titan  serum he urged him to find a family and  complete his mission afterwards krueger  willingly allows himself to be eaten by  grisha successfully transferring the  attack titan to him we are sure you all  knew about kruger but stick with us till  the end when we will be explaining some  of the more mysterious attack titans  anyway this leads us into our next  attack titan user grisha jaeger grisha  was born on liberia in the continent of  marley he was an aldean doctor and a  member of the elder restorationist  movement after zeke exposed his family  and all the restorationists they were  sentenced to go to paradise island as  pure titans he was saved by aaron  krueger and he also inherited his titan  powers after mysteriously showing up  outside walmaria he was found by keith  shadis grisha claimed to have suffered  amnesia and he had no memories about the  civilization inside the walls in the  military after he successfully  infiltrated inside of the walls he  started the family and had a son he  named aaron grisha used his occupation  as a doctor to get close with government  officials in order to gather some  information on the ruler of the walls he  eventually discovered the location of  the reese family's chapel however he  chose to delay his mission in favor of  staying with his new family during the  fall of shiganshina district grisha  reflects on what he must do the entire  way to the reach chapel grisham reveals  himself to be an aldian from beyond the  walls and begs free to reese to use her  founding titan ability to save  shiganjina from the titans that are  breaking in however succumbing to the  will of carl fritz she refuses to act he  is unable to bring himself to kill the  entire rhys family horrified at the  thought of killing children it is only  when aaron acting through the timeless  paths of the future demands he fulfill  his duty by reminding him of his fellow  restorationists and his dead sister faye  that grisha finally transforms grisha  easily beats frida in combat and devours  her before going on to slaughter the  entire reese family sparing only rod  reese on aaron's orders the next attack  titan we're going to talk about is of  course aaron yeager aaron was born in  shiganshina district within the southern  region of walmaria to karl jaeger and  grisha yeager during the fall of  shiganshina district aaron is sent to a  shelter for refugees from walmareia soon  after grisha arrives and finds aaron who  tells him that his mother was eaten  after hearing this grisha takes aaron to  a nearby forest and instructs him to go  to the basement before aaron can react  he is injected with titan's serum  turning him into a mindless titan aaron  instinctively eats his father receiving  his titan powers including the dormant  founding titan during the battle for  trost aaron tries to kill the titan that  ate his friend only to be incapacitated  by a second titan biting off his leg  aaron regains consciousness just in time  to save armin from being eaten being  swallowed himself in the process his  anguish triggers his first  transformation into his attack titan  form bursting out of the titan that  devoured him he proceeds to wreak havoc  on all the titans he finds this is the  first time an anime that we see the  attack titan in action aaron was later  challenged with many tasks that needed  his attack titan abilities for example  plugging the hole in wall rows as the  time went by he joined levi's squad and  hanji started doing experiments on him  but during those experiments aaron was  unable to activate his titan abilities  after the incident with a spoon with the  help of hanji's deductions aaron learns  that a titan transformation requires him  to have a clear goal in mind in addition  to self-injury throughout the anime we  see that aaron has more and more control  of his attack titan he manages to defeat  annie as well as overpower reiner in  hand-to-hand combat in season 4 when  aaron and cervicore launch an attack on  marley we get to see aaron fully in  control of his attack titan as he  transforms many times during a battle he  grew so strong that he managed to defeat  both warhammer titan and the jaw titan  with mikasa's help of course we don't  get to learn much about other attack  titans throughout history in flashback  about king fritz in the amir life we get  to see a glimpse of a first ever attack  titan it looked very different from all  other attack titans we saw in the anime  it had some very scary titan marks on  its face and long black hair as for the  others we only get to see them fighting  on aaron's founding titan during the  battle of heaven and earth where aaron  brought all the past titan shifters to  fight his friends a curly hair attack  titan can be seen atop of aaron as well  as another attack titan that looks more  like a normal human with a beard and  chest hair reminding of grisha's titan  annie is also seen battling a bald  attack titan to be honest we get to see  these titans very briefly and we only  have one picture of them so there isn't  any additional information about them  our artists drew them very well so all  of you can better see what they look  like click on this video to learn more  about all colossal titans in attack on  titan go on click it it's an amazing  video
 

